  m_text: 'Instructions

    1. Press Join Online to quickstart a lobby

    2. Have
    2nd player click Join Online

    3. Wait for all players to do step 2.

    4.
    Physically move to IRL room center,  face towards the sliding doors, and click
    the Calibrate button

    5. Have all players do step 4.

    6. Colocation!'
